---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Giscus from '@/components/Giscus.astro';
import CardGrid from '@/components/CardGrid.astro';
import Card from '@/components/Card.astro';
import Gallery from '@/components/Gallery.astro';
import Banner from '@/components/Banner.astro';
import { getMediaCards } from '@/lib/projects';
import mediaBannerImage from '@/assets/images/media/banner.jpg';
import evoqueImg from '@/assets/images/media/evoque-v2.jpg';
import protek25Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/protek-25.jpg';
import drone1Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone1.jpg';
import drone2Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone2.jpg';
import drone3Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone3.jpg';
import drone4Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone4.jpg';
import drone5Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone5.jpg';
import drone6Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone6.jpg';
import drone7Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone7.jpg';
import drone8Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone8.jpg';
import drone9Img from '@/assets/images/media/gear/drone9.jpg';

const projects = await getMediaCards('en');
---

<BaseLayout title="Media" description="Leonard Lemke" image={evoqueImg}>
  <Banner
    image={mediaBannerImage}
    title="Media"
    subtitle="Cinematic/Freestyle FPV"
    imageAlt="AI-generated abstract artwork of FPV drone light trails over a night sky"
    transitionName="hub-media"
  />

  <div class="center" id="projects" data-reveal="up">
    <h1 class="colored-h1">Projects</h1>
  </div>

  <CardGrid>
    {
      projects.map((project, i) => (
        <Card
          href={project.href}
          bgImg={project.bgImg}
          bgPosition={project.bgPosition}
          title={project.title}
          description={project.description}
          date={project.dateLabel}
          interactionIcon={project.interactionIcon}
          interactionText={project.interactionText}
          tags={project.tags}
          transitionName={project.transitionName}
          revealIndex={i}
          previewVideo={project.previewVideo}
        />
      ))
    }
  </CardGrid>

  <div class="content" id="fpv" data-reveal="up">
    <h1>What is Cinematic/Freestyle FPV?</h1>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <b>First-person view (FPV)</b> is a method where a radio-controlled aircraft (drone) is piloted remotely
        from a first-person perspective via an onboard camera, fed wirelessly to video FPV goggles.
      </li>
      <li><b>Freestyle FPV</b> is all about flying skills and doing nice tricks or movements.</li>
      <li>
        <b>Cinematic FPV</b> content tends to be slower and smoother than Freestyle FPV. The settings are chosen
        more for their visual attraction than for the technical flying skills they demand.
      </li>
    </ul>

    <h2>What is special about FPV?</h2>
    <p>The difference to normal drone pilots is that FPV pilots mostly build their drone(s) themselves.</p>
    <h3>This includes:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Search and buy parts</li>
      <li>Assembling the drone</li>
      <li>Setting up the drone (Software)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Furthermore, it requires much more practice, since FPV drones are usually flown in acro mode (acrobatic
      mode: e.g. when releasing the control sticks, the drone does not automatically level itself or if you move
      the sticks forward, the drone will pitch forward continuously instead of accelerating forward...).
    </p>
    <p>But the practice is worth it, because flying FPV is incredibly fun!</p>

    <h2>What got me into FPV?</h2>
    <Gallery full>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone1Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">The journey began with a normal consumer drone...</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone2Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">
          ... but ended very early with a broken drone and the fact, that its nearly impossible to repair those
          drones by your own.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone3Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">
          Since the repair at the manufacturer is quite expensive, i decided to build a drone myself... Which
          turned out not to be cheaper...
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone4Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">After researching for the needed parts, the assembly began.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone5Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">Assembling and wiring...</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone6Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">Getting the Hardware ready...</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone7Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">Setup and configuration of the software...</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone8Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">Done!</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <Image src={drone9Img} alt="" />
        <p class="description">
          Well (after a few encounters with the snowy ground)... seems a lot more durable than the drone before...
        </p>
      </div>
    </Gallery>
  </div>

  <div class="content" data-reveal="up">
    <h1 id="setup">Setup</h1>
    <h2 id="2023">2023</h2>
    <h3>iFlight Nazgul Evoque F5 V2 HD</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Frame: Nazgul F5 DeadCat</li>
      <li>Motor: XING2 2207 1855KV</li>
      <li>Props: Nazgul F5</li>
      <li>FC: BLITZ Mini F722</li>
      <li>ESC: BLITZ Mini E55 4-IN-1 2-6S 55A</li>
      <li>Video Transmission: DJI O3 Air Unit</li>
      <li>Receiver: TBS Crossfire Nano</li>
      <li>LiPo: Tattu R-LINE V4.0 1300mAh 130C 6S</li>
    </ul>
    <Image class="drone-image" src={evoqueImg} alt="iFlight Nazgul Evoque F5 V2 HD" />

    <br id="2021" /><br /><br />
    <h2>2021 - 2023</h2>
    <h3>Drone (Custom Build, 5 Inch)</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Frame: iFlight Cidora SL5</li>
      <li>Motor: iFlight XING-E 2306 1700KV</li>
      <li>Props: HQProp DP5X4.3X3V1S</li>
      <li>Stack: Mamba F722S 60A</li>
      <li>Video Transmission: Caddx Vista Kit / Air Unit Lite</li>
      <li>Receiver: TBS Crossfire Nano</li>
      <li>LiPo: Tattu R-LINE V3.0 1300mAh 120C 6S</li>
      <li>GoPro Hero 6 Black</li>
    </ul>
    <Image class="drone-image" src={drone8Img} alt="Drone (Custom Build, 5 Inch)" />
    <h3>Cinewhoop (iFlight ProTek25)</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Motor: iFlight XING 1404 4600KV</li>
      <li>Props: Nazgul 2525</li>
      <li>Stack: SucceX-D 20A Whoop AIO</li>
      <li>Video Transmission: Caddx Vista Kit / Air Unit Lite</li>
      <li>Receiver: TBS Crossfire Nano</li>
      <li>LiPo: Tattu R-LINE V1.0 850mAh 95C 4S</li>
      <li>Naked GoPro Hero 6 Black</li>
    </ul>
    <Image class="drone-image" src={protek25Img} alt="Cinewhoop (iFlight ProTek25)" />
    <h3>Other</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Radio: FrSky Taranis X-Lite S</li>
      <li>Goggles: DJI FPV Goggles V2</li>
      <li>Charger: HOTA D6 PRO DUAL Smart Charger AC/DC</li>
    </ul>

    <br id="2020" /><br /><br />
    <h2>2020 - 2021</h2>
    <h3>Drone (Custom Build, 5 Inch)</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Frame: iFlight Cidora SL5</li>
      <li>Motor: iFlight XING-E 2306 1700KV</li>
      <li>Props: HQProp DP5X4.3X3V1S</li>
      <li>Stack: Mamba F722S 60A</li>
      <li>Cam: Foxeer Falkor 2 Mini</li>
      <li>VTX: Rush Tank Ultimate</li>
      <li>Receiver: TBS Crossfire Nano</li>
      <li>LiPo: Goldbat 1300mAh 100C 6S</li>
      <li>GoPro Hero 6 Black</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>Other</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>Radio: FrSky Taranis X-Lite S</li>
      <li>Goggles: Eachine EV800D</li>
      <li>Charger: ISDT 600AC</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <Giscus />
</BaseLayout>
